mpression_count":952,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114169506784260471","type":"quoted"}],"text":"马斯克刚转了一条 Grok 对话，标题是「AI 最近挖出的灾难级漏洞」，配了一句 Wild times。\n\n里面最炸的是 PHP2Shell，牵涉大概 70% 的网站。OpenAI 的 Patch the Planet（跑 GPT-5.6 Sol）和 Wiz（跑 Gemini 4 Argon 和 GPT-5.6 Sol）在 8 月各自独立用 AI 把它挖出来，抢在黑客前头，拉着维护者和 https://t.co/qPtTBLvxsz","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114182748202258693"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T23:52:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114143118417436982"],"id":"2114143118417436982","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1605,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114052542518956441","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Grok 社区版主 blankspeaker（平时专门扒 X 和 Grok 预发包）从 Grok Bot 0.77.0 的 17 个预发构建里扒出 20 处新改动。\n\n最值得盯四块：\n一是通话面板 Calls panel，带拨号、转写、按了什么键、等待中状态，还能让 Bot 替你说或中途接过来。\n二是支付设置 Payments https://t.co/jDDSGCTQAM","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114143118417436982"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T14:04:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113995052406173874"],"id":"2113995052406173874","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1976,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113573567833252244","type":"quoted"}],"text":"没显卡也能跑 ComfyUI：租台云 4090，把 SSH 丢给 AI 装环境和模型，自己只改提示词里引号中的中文出图。\n\n作者用刚开源的 MOSS-Image，顺手和前一天出的 FLUX 3 Klein 同题打了 8 组。带字主标题两边基本都能印对，氛围各有味道。连换 30 次造型时人物会跳，要加社区构图控制适配器，前 30% https://t.co/wriKG9CZiL","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113995052406173874"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2113980410367787009"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T13:06:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113980463400493382"],"id":"2113980463400493382","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":61,"impression_count":11330,"like_count":66,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":6},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113561892505763850","type":"quoted"}],"text":"卧槽 ！！！ Grob  Bot 整个AI 日报也太方便了吧\n\n直接让 Bot 信息， 每天早上发过来\n\n再要求用 Pages 生成页面就好了 \n\n操作起来十分方便 https://t.co/TMvRISSXVM https://t.co/IOFPXdTj3c","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113980463400493382"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T12:16:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113967955746926723"],"id":"2113967955746926723","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":877,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113964399576895731","type":"quoted"}],"text":"今天深圳见到了很多在 X 上互动的大佬们,  线下见面的分享明显不一样 ,   还听了很多很多干货分享 https://t.co/pNk7iRzzLQ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113967955746926723"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T11:46:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113960346394476842"],"id":"2113960346394476842","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1421,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113948562354811274","type":"quoted"}],"text":"不拆机、不另掏 API 钱，一台 StackChan 桌面机器人就能接成贾维斯。\n\n中间塞开源网关 xiaozhi-hub-server，本机 Claude Code 当内脑动文件写网页，云端 Grok Bot 当外脑查新闻查情报。喊「嗨 Claude」走本地，喊「嗨 哨兵」走外网，大概 7 秒开口。\n\n硬条件就几条：只认 2.4G Wi-Fi，Mac https://t.co/gwLUUmeIgg","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113960346394476842"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T10:05:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113934908456608078"],"id":"2113934908456608078","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":151,"impression_count":16140,"like_count":122,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":27},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113514194687668731","type":"quoted"}],"text":"峰兄整理了 Grok Bot 90个模板，给大家省事了，不用一个一个去找了。\n\n包含免费领取的 AI 员工，按工程、销售、市场、设计、招聘、产品、运营、生活八个部门摆开。写代码、找客户、剪视频、做设计、排面试、理日程，都能对上一个岗位。 https://t.co/dOgnCt8SPh","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113934908456608078"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T09:21:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113923819102695711"],"id":"2113923819102695711","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":585,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"新起盘一个个人项目，一定先考虑自己能不能跑的成闭环。 \n\n任何一个项目如果没有一个牛逼的人已经在做了，证明这个业务本身就很难做"